#   * 个人侧（工作区、同步状态、inspect 快照、缓存）继续忽略
.vscode/*.code-workspace
.vscode/settings-sync*.json
.vscode/inspect*
.vscode/*.log
.vscode/globalStorage/
.vscode/workspaceStorage/
.vscode/History/
